 "format": "hex: the raw bytes to the chest, lower case, no spaces. allow_sit_down: the opt-in flag of the call. expect: allow or refuse. reason: sit_down_19, sit_down_40, len_below_min, not_whole, or null for allow. A guard that has no reason codes compares expect only.",
